#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: moksa-points-for-woocommerce.php
msgid "Moksa Points for WooCommerce"
msgstr "Moksa Points for WooCommerce"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: moksa-points-for-woocommerce.php
msgid "https://github.com/Moksa1123/moksa-points-for-woocommerce"
msgstr "https://github.com/Moksa1123/moksa-points-for-woocommerce"

#. Description of the plugin
#: moksa-points-for-woocommerce.php
msgid "The value engine for the Moksa platform: an idempotent points / store-credit ledger, earn rules, redeem, a checkout wallet, and Abilities/MCP. The single source of truth for customer balance — companion plugins read it, never store their own."
msgstr "Moksa 平台的價值引擎:具冪等性的點數 / 儲值金帳本、賺點規則、兌換、結帳錢包,以及 Abilities/MCP。顧客餘額的唯一真實來源 —— 其他外掛一律讀取它,絕不自行儲存。"

