#: src/Modules/Abilities/Ability.php:46
msgid "WooCommerce points / store credit balance lookup, reporting, and management capabilities"
msgstr "WooCommerce 點數 / 儲值金餘額查詢、報表與管理能力"

#: src/Modules/Abilities/Ability.php:59
msgid "Find a customer"
msgstr "尋找顧客"

#: src/Modules/Abilities/Ability.php:60
msgid "Search customers by name / email / username and return matching user_ids (so points lookups work from a name). Read-only."
msgstr "以姓名 / 電子郵件 / 使用者名稱搜尋顧客,回傳相符的 user_id(因此可用姓名查詢點數)。唯讀。"

#: src/Modules/Abilities/Ability.php:65
msgid "Name, email or username fragment to search"
msgstr "要搜尋的姓名、電子郵件或使用者名稱片段"

#: src/Modules/Abilities/Ability.php:66
msgid "Max results (default 10)"
msgstr "最多回傳筆數 (預設 10)"

#: src/Modules/Abilities/Ability.php:81
msgid "Get the active points campaign"
msgstr "取得進行中的點數活動"

#: src/Modules/Abilities/Ability.php:82
msgid "Return the currently active points campaign (limited-time multiplier / discount), or none. Read-only."
msgstr "回傳目前進行中的點數活動 (限時倍率 / 折扣),若無則回傳無。唯讀。"

#: src/Modules/Abilities/Ability.php:100
msgid "Get the points leaderboard"
msgstr "取得點數排行榜"

#: src/Modules/Abilities/Ability.php:101
msgid "Return the top customers ranked by total points earned. Read-only."
msgstr "依累計賺得點數回傳排名最前的顧客。唯讀。"

#: src/Modules/Abilities/Ability.php:106
msgid "How many top customers (default 10, max 100)"
msgstr "取前幾名顧客 (預設 10,最多 100)"

#: src/Modules/Abilities/Ability.php:107
msgid "all / month (default all)"
msgstr "all / month (預設 all)"

#: src/Modules/Abilities/Ability.php:122
msgid "Forecast points liability and breakage"
msgstr "預測點數負債與耗損"

#: src/Modules/Abilities/Ability.php:123
msgid "Return outstanding points, what they are worth, how much expires within 30/60/90 days, the historical breakage and redemption rates, recent issue/redeem velocity, and the balance distribution. Read-only."
msgstr "回傳未兌換點數、其價值、30/60/90 天內到期的數量、歷史耗損率與兌換率、近期發出 / 兌換流速,以及餘額分布。唯讀。"

#: src/Modules/Abilities/Ability.php:158
msgid "Suggest reward prices"
msgstr "建議獎勵定價"

#: src/Modules/Abilities/Ability.php:159
msgid "Suggest entry / core / aspirational reward prices from what members actually hold, with the reasoning and the share of members each price is within reach of. Read-only; nothing is created."
msgstr "依會員實際持有的點數,建議入門 / 主力 / 進階三種獎勵價位,並附上理由與各價位「多少比例的會員換得起」。唯讀,不會建立任何項目。"

#: src/Modules/Abilities/Ability.php:194
msgid "Get a customer badges"
msgstr "取得顧客徽章"

#: src/Modules/Abilities/Ability.php:195
msgid "Return a customer earned achievement badges, their next badge and total points earned. Read-only."
msgstr "回傳顧客已獲得的成就徽章、下一個徽章,以及累計賺得點數。唯讀。"

