msgstr "累計賺點跨越門檻時授予徽章(銅 / 銀 / 金),並在「我的點數」顯示。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:155
msgid "Show the member's current tier and the distance to the next one on \"My points\", plus the [moksafopoi_tier] shortcode. When the membership plugin (moformember) is installed its tiers are used; otherwise the ladder below applies."
msgstr "在「我的點數」顯示會員目前的階梯與距離下一階的差距,並提供 [moksafopoi_tier] 短碼。已安裝會員外掛 (moformember) 時使用它的分層,否則套用下方的階梯。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:156
msgid "Add the points balance / tier / quests / how-to-earn / leaderboard / redemption mall as blocks in the editor. Each block renders exactly what its shortcode renders."
msgstr "在編輯器中以區塊形式加入點數餘額 / 階梯 / 任務 / 如何賺點 / 排行榜 / 兌換商城。每個區塊的輸出與對應短碼完全相同。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:157
msgid "Missions such as \"complete 3 orders\" or \"leave a review\" that pay out points when finished; progress shows on \"My points\" and via the [moksafopoi_quests] shortcode."
msgstr "「完成 3 筆訂單」「留下一則評價」這類任務,達成後發放點數;進度會顯示在「我的點數」並可用 [moksafopoi_quests] 短碼呈現。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:158
msgid "A floating button in the bottom-right on the front end + a \"How to earn points\" popup (content assembled automatically from the enabled earning features), plus a \"You earned +N points\" hint on the thank-you page. Display only."
msgstr "前台右下角浮動按鈕 + 「如何賺點」彈窗(內容依已啟用的賺點功能自動組成),及感謝頁「本次獲得 +N 點」提示。純顯示。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:163
msgid "Tier ladder"
msgstr "階梯設定"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:164
msgid "The tiers used when the membership plugin is not installed. Tiers are reached on LIFETIME points earned, so spending never demotes a member. Leave a name blank to drop that rung."
msgstr "未安裝會員外掛時所使用的階梯。階梯依「終身累積賺得點數」判定,因此花點永遠不會使會員降級。名稱留空即可移除該階。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:166
msgid "Tiers"
msgstr "階梯"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:166
msgid "Name plus the lifetime points needed. The lowest rung is usually 0 so every member starts inside the ladder."
msgstr "階梯名稱與所需的終身累積點數。最低一階通常設為 0,讓每位會員一開始就在階梯內。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:167
msgid "Purchased points count towards tiers"
msgstr "買來的點數計入階梯"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:167
msgid "Off by default: points a customer BOUGHT (points pack) are spendable but do not raise their tier or unlock badges, so nobody can buy their way past members who earned it."
msgstr "預設關閉:顧客「購買」而來的點數 (點數包) 可以使用,但不會提升階梯或解鎖徽章,以免有人用錢買過真正賺上去的會員。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:173
msgid "Each quest pays its points ONCE, the moment a member reaches the target. Leave a name blank to remove that quest. Changing a target does not take points back from members who already finished it."
msgstr "每項任務在會員達標的當下只發放一次點數。名稱留空即可移除該任務。調整目標值不會向已完成的會員收回點數。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:175
msgid "Quest list"
msgstr "任務清單"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:175
msgid "Name, what is counted, how many times, and the reward."
msgstr "名稱、計數的事件、次數,以及獎勵。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:180
msgid "Email appearance"
msgstr "信件外觀"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:181
msgid "The shared email appearance for all notification emails sent to members (such as expiry reminders): the header background color and header text. A live preview is shown below."
msgstr "所有寄給會員的通知信(如到期提醒)共用的信件外觀:標頭底色與標頭文字。下方有即時預覽。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:183
msgid "The background color of the band at the top of the email (default gold #d4af37)."
msgstr "信件頂端色帶的背景色(預設金色 #d4af37)。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:184
msgid "The text shown in the band at the top of the email (empty = site name)."
msgstr "信件頂端色帶顯示的文字(留空 = 站名)。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:184
msgid "Empty = site name"
msgstr "留空 = 站名"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:189
msgid "Points validity / expiry reminder"
msgstr "點數有效期 / 到期提醒"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:190
msgid "How many months after being earned points expire (0 = never expires), and how many days before expiry to email a reminder to members."
msgstr "點數會在賺到後幾個月到期(0 = 永不過期),以及到期前幾天寄信提醒會員。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:192
msgid "How many months after the earned date points expire (0 = never expires)."
msgstr "點數自賺到日起幾個月到期(0 = 永不過期)。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:193
msgid "Email a reminder to members before points expire (automatically disabled when set to never expire)."
msgstr "在點數到期前寄信提醒會員(永不過期時自動停用)。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:194
msgid "How many days before points expire to send the reminder email (default 14 days)."
msgstr "點數到期前幾天寄出提醒信(預設 14 天)。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:199
msgid "Event-based notification emails (earn / redeem)"
msgstr "事件式通知信(賺點 / 兌點)"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:200
msgid "Custom notification emails sent automatically when a member earns / redeems points. Requires \"Event-based notification emails\" to be enabled. Available variables: {points} {balance} {note} {name} {site}. \"Throttle\" is the minimum interval between emails for the same event to the same member (in seconds, 0 = no limit)."
msgstr "會員賺點 / 兌點時自動寄送的自訂通知信。需啟用「事件式通知信」。可用變數:{points} {balance} {note} {name} {site}。「節流」是同一會員同一事件的最短寄信間隔(秒,0 = 不限)。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:202
msgid "Earn points notification email"
msgstr "賺點通知信"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:202
msgid "Sent when a member earns points."
msgstr "會員賺到點數時寄出。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:203
msgid "Earn email subject"
msgstr "賺點信主旨"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:203
#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:209
msgid "Leave empty to use the default. The variables above are available."
msgstr "留空用預設。可用上方變數。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:204
msgid "Earn email body"
msgstr "賺點信內文"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:204
#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:210
msgid "Leave empty to use the default; one paragraph per line. The variables above are available."
msgstr "留空用預設;每行一段。可用上方變數。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:205
msgid "Earn email recipient"
msgstr "賺點信收件人"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:205
#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:211
msgid "Send to member / admin / both."
msgstr "寄給會員 / 管理員 / 兩者。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:205
#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:211
msgid "Admin"
msgstr "管理員"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:205
#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:211
msgid "Both"
msgstr "兩者"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:206
msgid "Earn email threshold (points)"
msgstr "賺點信門檻(點)"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:206
msgid "Send only when points earned reach this value (0 = no limit)."
msgstr "賺到點數達此值才寄(0 = 不限)。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:207
msgid "Earn email throttle (seconds)"
msgstr "賺點信節流(秒)"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:207
msgid "Minimum interval between two earn emails to the same member (0 = send every time)."
msgstr "同一會員兩封賺點信的最短間隔(0 = 每次都寄)。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:208
msgid "Redeem points notification email"
msgstr "兌點通知信"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:208
msgid "Sent when a member uses / redeems points."
msgstr "會員使用 / 兌換點數時寄出。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:209
msgid "Redeem email subject"
msgstr "兌點信主旨"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:210
msgid "Redeem email body"
msgstr "兌點信內文"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:211
msgid "Redeem email recipient"
msgstr "兌點信收件人"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:212
msgid "Redeem email threshold (points)"
msgstr "兌點信門檻(點)"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:212
msgid "Send only when points used reach this value (0 = no limit)."
msgstr "使用點數達此值才寄(0 = 不限)。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:213
msgid "Redeem email throttle (seconds)"
msgstr "兌點信節流(秒)"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:213
msgid "Minimum interval between two redeem emails to the same member (0 = send every time)."
msgstr "同一會員兩封兌點信的最短間隔(0 = 每次都寄)。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:219
msgid "How customers earn points / store credit."
msgstr "顧客如何賺到點數 / 儲值金。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:221
msgid "Add points by rule after order payment (spend N to earn Y points)."
msgstr "訂單付款後依規則加點(消費 N 元得 Y 點)。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:222
msgid "Set \"this category's points multiplier\" on the product category edit page; applied line by line when earning points."
msgstr "在商品分類編輯頁設「此分類點數倍率」,賺點時逐行套用。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:223
msgid "Earn points with coupons"
msgstr "用券集點"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:223
msgid "Award extra points when customers use a coupon (requires the coupon plugin)."
msgstr "顧客使用優惠券時額外加點(需搭配優惠券外掛)。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:224
msgid "After order payment, give back a configured percentage of the amount as the customer's store credit (redeemable at checkout); refunds reverse automatically. See the store credit economy on the \"Redeem\" tab for the ratio / threshold."
msgstr "訂單付款後回饋設定比例的金額為顧客儲值金(可結帳折抵);退款自動反向。比例 / 門檻見「折抵」分頁的儲值金經濟。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:225
msgid "Mark a product as a \"gift card\" on the product edit page; after purchase, its face value is added to the customer's store credit (redeemable at checkout); refunds reverse automatically."
msgstr "在商品編輯頁把商品勾選為「禮品卡」,購買後面額加值為顧客儲值金(可結帳折抵);退款自動反向。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:230
msgid "Spend"
msgstr "花用"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:231
msgid "How customers use points / store credit."
msgstr "顧客如何使用點數 / 儲值金。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:233
msgid "Checkout redemption with points"
msgstr "結帳以點數折抵"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:233
msgid "Let customers redeem their points balance as a discount at checkout (classic and block checkout), using the redemption rate and limits below."
msgstr "讓顧客在結帳時以點數餘額折抵(傳統與區塊結帳皆支援),依下方的兌換比率與上限計算。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:234
msgid "Checkout redemption with wallet"
msgstr "結帳折抵錢包"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:234
msgid "Redeem using your store credit balance at checkout (takes over checkout redemption; deducted after payment)."
msgstr "結帳時用儲值金餘額折抵(接管結帳折抵,付款後扣帳)。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:235
msgid "Reclaim points on refund"
msgstr "退款扣回點數"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:235
msgid "When an order is cancelled / refunded, reclaim the points awarded for that purchase (the balance will not go negative); store credit redemption and gift cards / cashback are reversed by their own features."
msgstr "訂單取消 / 退款時,扣回該筆消費發放的點數(餘額不會變成負數);儲值金折抵、禮品卡 / 回饋則由各自功能反向處理。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:236
msgid "Redeem points for coupons / products / cart discount."
msgstr "用點數兌換優惠券 / 商品 / 購物車折抵。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:237
msgid "Redemption catalog management"
msgstr "兌換型錄管理"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:237
msgid "Add / edit / delete / list or delist redeemable items in the admin (used by \"Points redemption\")."
msgstr "在後台新增 / 編輯 / 刪除 / 上下架可兌換的項目(供「點數兌換」使用)。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:238
msgid "Batch issue / revoke points in the admin (by role or list); support staff can search for a single member to manually add or deduct; quick add / deduct on the member edit page."
msgstr "後台批次發放 / 撤銷點數(依角色或名單)、客服搜尋單一會員手動加扣、會員編輯頁快速加扣。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:239
msgid "Members refer friends with a personal link; both sides earn points after the friend completes their first purchase. Shortcode [moksafopoi_referral]."
msgstr "會員用專屬連結推薦好友,好友完成首購後雙方得點。短碼 [moksafopoi_referral]。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:240
msgid "Earn / redeem events trigger custom notification emails (recipient / threshold / throttling). Configure the content on the \"Notification emails\" tab."
msgstr "賺點 / 兌點事件觸發自訂通知信(收件人 / 門檻 / 節流)。內容在「通知信」分頁設定。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:245
msgid "Points branding"
msgstr "點數品牌化"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:246
msgid "Customize the unit name for points. Once changed, the My Account area, points store, leaderboard, badge progress, and admin dashboard all display the new unit."
msgstr "自訂點數的單位名稱。改了之後,會員中心、點數商城、排行榜、徽章進度與後台儀表板都會同步顯示新單位。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:248
msgid "The points unit shown to customers (default \"points\"; can be changed to \"coins / miles / P\", etc.)."
msgstr "顯示給顧客看的點數單位(預設「點」,可改成「金幣 / 哩程 / P」等)。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:248
msgid "For example: coins"
msgstr "例如:金幣"

