msgstr "商品頁賺點預覽"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:254
msgid "Show \"Earn about X points on purchase\" on individual product pages so customers see the reward before adding to cart. Requires \"Earn points on purchase\" to be enabled first."
msgstr "在單一商品頁顯示「購買可得約 X 點」,讓顧客在加入購物車前就看到回饋。需先啟用「消費集點」。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:256
msgid "Show earning preview"
msgstr "顯示賺點預覽"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:256
msgid "Show the estimated points earnable on the product page (based on the product price × rate, applying per-product and per-category settings)."
msgstr "在商品頁顯示可得點數估算(依該商品價格 × 比例,並套用個別商品與分類的設定)。"

