#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:295
msgid "A \"how to earn points\" guide, an earned-points toast after checkout, and a shareable achievement card. Display only — none of these write to the ledger, and every figure is read from the features you already switched on."
msgstr "「如何賺點」指南、結帳後的賺點提示,以及可分享的成就卡。純顯示 —— 這些都不會寫入帳本,每個數字都讀自你已啟用的功能。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:297
msgid "Master switch for the three surfaces below."
msgstr "下列三個介面的總開關。"

