msgid "\"How to earn points\" guide"
msgstr "「如何賺點」指南"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:298
msgid "Show the guide under \"My points\" and provide the [moksafopoi_how_to_earn] shortcode. Its content is assembled automatically from the enabled earning features."
msgstr "在「我的點數」下方顯示指南,並提供 [moksafopoi_how_to_earn] 短碼。內容會依已啟用的賺點功能自動組成。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:299
msgid "Earned-points toast"
msgstr "賺點提示"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:299
msgid "On the order-received page, show the points this order actually booked (read from the ledger; nothing is shown when no points were awarded)."
msgstr "在訂單完成頁顯示這張訂單實際入帳的點數 (讀自帳本;沒有發放點數時不顯示)。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:300
msgid "One-off points the first time a member shares on each channel (0 = sharing earns nothing). Sharing cannot be verified from the store, so the bonus is deliberately once per channel for life."
msgstr "會員在每個管道第一次分享時可得的一次性點數 (0 = 分享不給點)。分享無法從商店端驗證,因此這項獎勵刻意設計成每個管道終生只給一次。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:301
msgid "Shareable achievement card"
msgstr "可分享的成就卡"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:301
msgid "Let members share their own points / badges to LINE or Facebook, or copy the link. Uses their referral link when the referral feature is on."
msgstr "讓會員把自己的點數 / 徽章分享到 LINE 或 Facebook,或複製連結。已啟用推薦好友功能時,分享的是會員本人的推薦連結。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:306
msgid "Shop listing earning hint"
msgstr "商店列表賺點提示"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:307
msgid "Below each product card in the shop / category listing, show the estimated points earnable on purchase (applies per-product and per-category settings; products that earn no points are not shown)."
msgstr "在商店 / 分類列表的每張商品卡下方,顯示購買可得的預估點數(會套用個別商品與分類的設定;不賺點的商品不顯示)。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:309
msgid "Show earning in the shop listing"
msgstr "在商店列表顯示賺點"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:309
msgid "Show \"Earn X points on purchase\" below the product listing card."
msgstr "在商品列表卡片下方顯示「購買可得 X 點」。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:312
msgid "Listing message template"
msgstr "列表訊息範本"

#. translators: do not translate the {tokens}.
#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:314
msgid "Copy for the listing card. Available variables: {points}, {points_label}, {value}. Basic HTML is allowed."
msgstr "列表卡片的文案。可用變數:{points}、{points_label}、{value}。允許基本 HTML。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:317
msgid "Text color of the listing message (default black #000000)."
msgstr "列表訊息的文字顏色(預設黑色 #000000)。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:318
msgid "Background color of the listing message (leave blank = transparent)."
msgstr "列表訊息的背景色(留空 = 透明)。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:325
msgid "Where the message is placed on each product card."
msgstr "訊息要掛在每張商品卡的哪個位置。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:328
msgid "Below the product title"
msgstr "商品標題下方"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:329
msgid "Above the product title"
msgstr "商品標題上方"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:330
msgid "After the price"
msgstr "價格之後"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:337
msgid "Cart earning hint"
msgstr "購物車賺點提示"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:338
msgid "Show the estimated points earnable from this purchase in the cart totals area (marked as \"approx.\", not yet including the spend-threshold multiplier)."
msgstr "在購物車總計區顯示這次購物可得的預估點數(以「約」標示,尚未計入滿額加倍)。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:340
msgid "Show earning in the cart"
msgstr "在購物車顯示賺點"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:340
msgid "Show \"Earn about X points from this purchase\" below the cart totals."
msgstr "在購物車總計下方顯示「本次消費可得約 X 點」。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:343
msgid "Cart message template"
msgstr "購物車訊息範本"

#. translators: do not translate the {tokens}.
#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:345
msgid "Copy for the cart. Available variables: {points}, {points_label}, {value}. Basic HTML is allowed."
msgstr "購物車的文案。可用變數:{points}、{points_label}、{value}。允許基本 HTML。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:348
msgid "Text color of the cart message (default black #000000)."
msgstr "購物車訊息的文字顏色(預設黑色 #000000)。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:349
msgid "Background color of the cart message (leave blank = transparent)."
msgstr "購物車訊息的背景色(留空 = 透明)。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:356
msgid "Where the message is placed in the cart totals area."
msgstr "訊息要掛在購物車總計區的哪個位置。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:359
msgid "Below the order total"
msgstr "訂單總計下方"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:360
msgid "Above the order total"
msgstr "訂單總計上方"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:361
msgid "After the cart table"
msgstr "購物車表格之後"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:368
msgid "My Account message"
msgstr "會員中心訊息"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:369
msgid "Add a custom message below the \"My points\" balance card (optional; leave blank to hide). {points} is replaced with the member's current balance."
msgstr "在「我的點數」餘額卡下方加一句自訂訊息(選配,留空則不顯示)。{points} 代入會員目前餘額。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:373
msgid "My Account message template"
msgstr "會員中心訊息範本"

#. translators: do not translate the {tokens}.
#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:375
msgid "Additional copy for the My points page. Available variables: {points} (current balance), {points_label}, {value}. Basic HTML is allowed. Leave blank to hide."
msgstr "我的點數頁的附加文案。可用變數:{points}(目前餘額)、{points_label}、{value}。允許基本 HTML。留空則不顯示。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:378
msgid "Text color of the My Account message (default black #000000)."
msgstr "會員中心訊息的文字顏色(預設黑色 #000000)。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:379
msgid "Background color of the My Account message (leave blank = transparent)."
msgstr "會員中心訊息的背景色(留空 = 透明)。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:386
msgid "Where the message is placed on the \"My points\" page."
msgstr "訊息要掛在「我的點數」頁的哪個位置。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:389
msgid "Below the balance card"
msgstr "餘額卡下方"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:396
msgid "Earning rate"
msgstr "賺點比例"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:397
msgid "The calculation granularity for earning points on purchase: how many points per unit spent, the rounding method, sale-price exclusion, per-order cap, and whether the earning base includes shipping / tax."
msgstr "消費集點的計算粒度:每元給幾點、進位方式、特價排除、單筆上限,以及賺點基底是否含運費 / 稅額。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:399
msgid "How many points to award per 1 unit of the purchase base (decimals allowed, e.g. 0.5)."
msgstr "消費基底每 1 元給多少點(可填小數,如 0.5)。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:403
msgid "How fractional points are rounded. Default is round down (safest for the store)."
msgstr "小數點數如何取整。預設無條件捨去(對店家最安全)。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:406
msgid "Round down"
msgstr "無條件捨去"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:407
msgid "Round half up"
msgstr "四捨五入"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:408
msgid "Round up"
msgstr "無條件進位"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:411
msgid "When checked, products currently on sale are excluded from the earning base."
msgstr "勾選後,正在特價的商品不計入賺點基底。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:412
msgid "When checked, shipping is also included in the earning base (excluded by default; only the product amount counts)."
msgstr "勾選後,運費也計入賺點基底(預設不含,只算商品金額)。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:413
msgid "When checked, tax is also included in the earning base (excluded by default; only the product amount counts)."
msgstr "勾選後,稅額也計入賺點基底(預設不含,只算商品金額)。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:414
msgid "Maximum points awarded per order (0 = no limit)."
msgstr "單一訂單最多給多少點(0 = 不限)。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:419
msgid "Role multiplier / spend-threshold multiplier"
msgstr "角色加倍 / 滿額加倍"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:420
msgid "Advanced earning multipliers. Final multiplier = membership tier (filter) × role multiplier × spend-threshold multiplier; category multipliers are applied row by row. Each multiplier is capped at 10×."
msgstr "進階賺點倍率。最終倍率 = 會員等級(filter)× 角色倍率 × 滿額加倍;分類倍率逐行套用。每個倍率上限 10 倍。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:422
msgid "Role earning multiplier"
msgstr "角色賺點倍率"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:422
msgid "Set an earning multiplier for each user role (default 1). Each customer's \"highest role multiplier\" is multiplied into their total earning."
msgstr "為每個會員角色設賺點倍率(預設 1)。顧客取其「最高角色倍率」乘進總賺點。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:423
msgid "Spend-threshold multiplier tiers"
msgstr "滿額加倍門檻"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:423
msgid "When the order's earnable base amount reaches the threshold, the entire earning is multiplied by the corresponding multiplier. Enter 0 to disable that tier."
msgstr "訂單可賺基底金額達門檻時,整筆賺點乘上對應倍率。填 0 = 停用該階。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:428
msgid "Buy a whole product with points only"
msgstr "純點數購買整件商品"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:429
msgid "Provide a \"Redeem the whole product for X points\" button on the product page (creates an NT$0 order). Set the points price for each product on the \"General\" tab of the product editor. Point deduction uses a per-user lock to prevent concurrent double-spending, and points are automatically refunded on failure."
msgstr "在商品頁提供「用 X 點兌換整件商品」按鈕(建 NT$0 訂單)。每件商品在商品編輯頁的「一般」分頁設定點數售價。扣點加每使用者鎖防並發雙花,失敗自動退點。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:431
msgid "Enable buy with points only"
msgstr "啟用純點數購買"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:431
msgid "For products with a points price set, members can redeem the whole item directly with points on the product page (NT$0 order)."
msgstr "有設定點數售價的商品,會員可在商品頁直接用點數兌換整件(NT$0 訂單)。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:436
msgid "Points transfer (between members)"
msgstr "點數轉贈(會員互轉)"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:437
msgid "Let members transfer points to other members. Place the shortcode [moksafopoi_transfer] in the My Account area / any page. Point deduction uses a per-user lock to prevent concurrent double-spending, and the amount is conserved."
msgstr "讓會員把點數轉贈給其他會員。把短碼 [moksafopoi_transfer] 放到會員中心 / 任一頁面。扣點加每使用者鎖防並發雙花,金額守恆。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:439
msgid "Enable points transfer"
msgstr "啟用點數轉贈"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:439
msgid "Provide the [moksafopoi_transfer] shortcode so members can transfer points to each other."
msgstr "提供 [moksafopoi_transfer] 短碼讓會員互轉點數。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:440
msgid "Minimum points per transfer"
msgstr "每次最少轉贈點數"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:440
msgid "Minimum points for a single transfer (default 1)."
msgstr "單次轉贈的最低點數(預設 1)。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:441
msgid "Maximum points per transfer"
msgstr "每次最多轉贈點數"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:441
msgid "Maximum points for a single transfer (0 = no limit)."
msgstr "單次轉贈的上限點數(0 = 不限)。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:442
msgid "Daily transfer count limit per person"
msgstr "每人每日轉贈次數上限"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:442
msgid "How many transfers a single member can send per day (0 = no limit)."
msgstr "同一會員每天最多可送出幾次轉贈(0 = 不限)。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:447
msgid "Points redemption rate"
msgstr "點數折抵比例"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:448
msgid "The calculation granularity for checkout points redemption: how many points redeem 1 unit of currency, minimum / step / cap."
msgstr "結帳點數折抵的計算粒度:幾點折 1 元、最低 / 級距 / 上限。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:450
msgid "How many points are needed to redeem 1 unit of currency (default 100 points = NT$1)."
msgstr "需要多少點才能折抵 1 元(預設 100 點 = NT$1)。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:451
msgid "Below this number of points, redemption cannot be used (default 100)."
msgstr "低於此點數不能使用折抵(預設 100)。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:452
msgid "How many points each redemption applies per unit (default 100)."
msgstr "每次折抵以幾點為單位(預設 100)。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:453
msgid "Maximum percentage of the redeemable subtotal that points can offset (default 100)."
msgstr "點數最多折掉可折小計的百分之多少(預設 100)。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:454
msgid "Maximum amount that points can offset per order (0 = no limit)."
msgstr "單一訂單點數最多折抵多少元(0 = 不限)。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:459
msgid "Redemption condition restrictions"
msgstr "折抵條件限制"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:460
msgid "Restrict which products / which members can pay with points, and whether it is mutually exclusive with coupons. Leave empty = no limit."
msgstr "限制哪些商品 / 哪些會員可用點折抵,以及是否與優惠券互斥。留空 = 不限。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:462
msgid "Limit redeemable categories"
msgstr "限定可折抵分類"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:462
msgid "Only amounts from these product categories (including subcategories) can be paid with points; multiple selection allowed (leave empty = all products eligible)."
msgstr "只有這些商品分類(含子分類)的金額可用點數折抵;可多選(留空 = 所有商品皆可)。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:463
msgid "Minimum membership tier for redemption"
msgstr "最低可折抵會員等級"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:463
msgid "Only members at this tier (and above) can pay with points; enter the membership tier code (e.g. gold). This restriction is automatically ignored when no member plugin is installed."
msgstr "僅該等級(含)以上會員可用點折抵;填會員等級代碼(如 gold)。未安裝會員外掛時此限制自動忽略。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:464
msgid "Disable points redemption when a coupon is present"
msgstr "有優惠券時停用點數折抵"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:464
msgid "When a coupon is already applied to the cart, points redemption is not allowed (coupon or points, not both)."
msgstr "購物車已套用優惠券時,不允許再用點數折抵(券與點二擇一)。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:469
msgid "One-time earning bonuses (signup / first purchase)"
msgstr "一次性賺點獎勵(註冊 / 首購)"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:470
msgid "Reward members once for registering and once for their first purchase. Off by default (0). Requires the \"Earning triggers\" module to be enabled."
msgstr "分別在會員註冊與首次購買時各給一次獎勵。預設關閉(0)。需啟用「賺點觸發」模組。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:472
msgid "Registration bonus points"
msgstr "註冊獎勵點數"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:472
msgid "Points awarded once when a member registers (0 = off)."
msgstr "會員註冊時給一次的點數(0 = 關閉)。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:473
msgid "First-purchase bonus points"
msgstr "首購獎勵點數"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:473
msgid "Points awarded once when a member completes their first purchase (0 = off)."
msgstr "會員完成首次購買時給一次的點數(0 = 關閉)。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:478
msgid "Check-in / birthday earning (repeatable trigger)"
msgstr "簽到 / 生日賺點(可重複觸發)"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:479
msgid "Daily check-in and birthday gift. Place the check-in shortcode [moksafopoi_checkin] on the member page, limited to once per day; the birthday gift is once per year (requires a member plugin to provide birthday data). Requires the \"Earning triggers\" module to be enabled."
msgstr "每日簽到與生日賀禮。簽到用短碼 [moksafopoi_checkin] 放到會員頁,每日限一次;生日賀禮每年一次(需會員外掛提供生日資料)。需啟用「賺點觸發」模組。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:481
msgid "Daily check-in points"
msgstr "每日簽到送點"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:481
msgid "Points a member can earn for daily check-in (0 = off; shortcode [moksafopoi_checkin])."
msgstr "會員每日簽到可得點數(0 = 關閉;短碼 [moksafopoi_checkin])。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:482
msgid "Birthday gift points"
msgstr "生日賀禮送點"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:482
msgid "Points automatically given on a member's birthday, once per year (0 = off; requires a member plugin installed and birthday data)."
msgstr "會員生日當天自動送點,每年一次(0 = 關閉;需安裝會員外掛並有生日資料)。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:483
msgid "Membership anniversary gift points"
msgstr "入會週年禮送點"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:483
msgid "Points automatically given on a member's registration anniversary, once per year (0 = off; based only on the registration date, no birthday data needed)."
msgstr "會員註冊週年日自動送點,每年一次(0 = 關閉;只依註冊日計算,不需生日資料)。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:484
msgid "Product review points"
msgstr "商品評論送點"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:484
msgid "Points a member can earn for each approved product review (default 20; 0 = off)."
msgstr "會員每則已核准的商品評論可得點數(預設 20;0 = 關閉)。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:485
msgid "Points-eligible reviews per product (count)"
msgstr "每商品評論送點上限(次)"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:485
msgid "The maximum number of reviews for which the same member can be rewarded for the same product, preventing review farming for points (0 = no limit)."
msgstr "同一會員對同一商品最多可獲獎勵的評論次數,防止刷評論賺點(0 = 不限)。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:490
msgid "Total earning cap (anti-abuse safeguard)"
msgstr "賺點總量上限(防刷安全閥)"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:491
msgid "Limit how many points each member can earn in total from all sources combined within a period, preventing campaign stacking from being abused. This is a \"total\" cap, a different dimension from the \"per-order cap\" or \"how many times per day per action\". Off by default. Purchase-based earning and system sources (transfer in / point purchase / import / scheduled / manual) are always automatically excluded and not subject to this cap."
msgstr "限制每位會員在一段期間內「所有來源合計」最多能賺多少點,防止活動疊加被刷。這是「總量」上限,與「單筆訂單上限」「某動作每日幾次」是不同維度。預設關閉。購買集點與系統來源(轉入 / 購點 / 匯入 / 排程 / 手動)一律自動排除,不受此限。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:495
msgid "Cap period"
msgstr "上限週期"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:496
msgid "Which period is used to calculate the total earning cap. Off = not applied."
msgstr "以哪個週期計算賺點總量上限。關閉 = 不套用。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:499
msgid "Off (no limit)"
msgstr "關閉(不限)"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:500
#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:535
msgid "Daily"
msgstr "每日"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:501
msgid "Weekly (starting Monday)"
msgstr "每週(週一起算)"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:502
#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:537
msgid "Monthly"
msgstr "每月"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:503
#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:538
msgid "Yearly"
msgstr "每年"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:504
msgid "Cumulative (lifetime)"
msgstr "累計(終身)"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:507
msgid "Cap earnable per period (points)"
msgstr "每期可賺上限(點)"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:507
msgid "The maximum points that can be earned from all (non-excluded) sources combined within that period (0 = no limit). The excess is automatically trimmed and not recorded."
msgstr "該週期內所有(未排除)來源合計最多可賺多少點(0 = 不限)。超過的部分自動裁切、不入帳。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:508
msgid "Excluded sources"
msgstr "排除來源"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:508
msgid "Earning sources not counted toward the cap (one per line or comma-separated). By default, purchase-based earning spend_rule is excluded so high-spending members are not mistakenly blocked. You can enter: spend_rule, coupon_redeemed, signup, review, first_order, checkin, birthday."
msgstr "不計入上限的賺點來源(每行或逗號分隔)。預設排除消費集點 spend_rule,讓高消費會員不被誤擋。可填:spend_rule、coupon_redeemed、signup、review、first_order、checkin、birthday。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:513
msgid "Earning exclusion list (staff / wholesale / test accounts)"
msgstr "賺點排除名單(員工 / 批發 / 測試帳號)"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:514
msgid "Roles or accounts on this list will never earn any points (all earning sources are not recorded); spending points, store credit, and manual support adjustments are unaffected. Leaving both fields empty = exclude no one."
msgstr "名單內的角色或帳號完全不會賺到點數(所有賺點來源一律不入帳);花點、儲值金與客服手動調整不受影響。兩欄留空 = 不排除任何人。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:516
msgid "Excluded roles"
msgstr "排除角色"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:516
msgid "Role slugs, one per line or comma-separated, for example: administrator, shop_manager, wholesale_customer."
msgstr "角色代稱(slug),每行或逗號分隔,例如:administrator、shop_manager、wholesale_customer。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:517
msgid "Excluded accounts"
msgstr "排除帳號"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:517
msgid "Member ID / email / username, one per line or comma-separated. Items that cannot be found are automatically ignored."
msgstr "會員 ID / Email / 帳號,每行或逗號分隔。找不到的項目自動忽略。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:523
msgid "Members refer friends via a dedicated link ?mfp_ref=; after a friend registers and completes their first purchase, both sides each earn points (once per friend, with a configurable per-period cap). Shortcode [moksafopoi_referral]. Requires the \"Referral points\" module to be enabled."
msgstr "會員用專屬連結 ?mfp_ref= 推薦好友;好友註冊並完成首購後,雙方各得點(每位好友一次、可設每期上限)。短碼 [moksafopoi_referral]。需啟用「推薦好友得點」模組。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:525
msgid "Referrer reward points"
msgstr "推薦人獎勵點數"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:525
msgid "Points the referrer can earn when the friend completes their first purchase (0 = none)."
msgstr "好友完成首購時,推薦人可得的點數(0 = 不給)。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:526
msgid "Referred friend reward points"
msgstr "被推薦好友獎勵點數"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:526
msgid "Extra points the referred friend can earn when completing their first purchase (0 = none)."
msgstr "被推薦的好友完成首購時額外可得的點數(0 = 不給)。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:527
msgid "Qualifying order threshold (NT$)"
msgstr "合格訂單門檻(NT$)"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:527
msgid "The friend's order product subtotal must reach this amount to count as a qualifying referral (0 = no limit)."
msgstr "好友訂單商品小計需達此金額才算合格推薦(0 = 不限)。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:528
msgid "Referral cap per period (count)"
msgstr "每期推薦上限(次)"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:528
msgid "The maximum number of referrals for which the same referrer can be rewarded within each period (0 = no limit)."
msgstr "同一推薦人每個週期最多可獲獎勵的推薦次數(0 = 不限)。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:531
msgid "Referral cap period"
msgstr "推薦上限週期"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:532
msgid "Calculated together with the count cap above."
msgstr "搭配上方次數上限計算。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:536
msgid "Weekly"
msgstr "每週"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:539
msgid "No time limit"
msgstr "不限期間"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:546
msgid "Store credit economy (purchase cashback / redemption)"
msgstr "儲值金經濟(消費回饋 / 折抵)"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:547
msgid "Cashback of spending into store credit, and the ratio cap for using store credit at checkout. Requires the \"Cashback\" / \"Wallet checkout redemption\" module to be enabled."
msgstr "消費回饋成儲值金,以及結帳可用儲值金折抵的比例上限。需搭配啟用「消費回饋」/「結帳折抵錢包」模組。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:549
msgid "Cashback %"
msgstr "消費回饋 %"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:549
msgid "What percentage of the order amount is returned as store credit (0 = no cashback)."
msgstr "訂單金額回饋多少 % 為儲值金(0 = 不回饋)。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:550
msgid "Cashback calculation base"
msgstr "回饋計算基底"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:550
msgid "Calculate cashback based on the product subtotal (excluding tax) or the order total."
msgstr "以商品小計(未稅)或訂單總額計算回饋。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:550
msgid "Product subtotal (excluding tax)"
msgstr "商品小計(未稅)"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:550
msgid "Order total"
msgstr "訂單總額"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:551
msgid "Cashback threshold (NT$)"
msgstr "回饋門檻(NT$)"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:551
msgid "Cashback applies only when the order base reaches this amount (0 = no limit)."
msgstr "訂單基底達此金額才回饋(0 = 不限)。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:552
msgid "Cashback cap per order (NT$)"
msgstr "單筆回饋上限(NT$)"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:552
msgid "The maximum store credit returned for a single order (0 = no limit)."
msgstr "單一訂單最多回饋多少儲值金(0 = 不限)。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:553
msgid "Store credit max cart offset %"
msgstr "儲值金最多折購物車 %"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:553
msgid "The maximum percentage of the redeemable subtotal that store credit can offset at checkout (default 100)."
msgstr "結帳時儲值金最多折抵可折小計的百分之多少(預設 100)。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:558
msgid "Multi-currency rates"
msgstr "多幣別比率"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:559
msgid "Only needed when your store sells in more than one currency (WPML / Aelia / FOX / WOOCS). Order totals arrive in the CUSTOMER's currency, so a rate calibrated for your base currency would award wildly different amounts for the same real spend. Leave a row blank to convert the base rate with your currency plugin's own exchange rate."
msgstr "只有在商店以多種貨幣銷售時才需要設定 (WPML / Aelia / FOX / WOOCS)。訂單總額是以「顧客的」貨幣計算,若沿用以本位幣校準的比率,同樣的實質消費會給出天差地遠的點數。整列留空即可用貨幣外掛本身的匯率換算本位比率。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:561
msgid "Per-currency rates"
msgstr "逐幣別比率"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:561
msgid "Points earned per 1 unit, and points needed to redeem 1 unit, for each currency you sell in."
msgstr "你所販售的每種貨幣,每 1 元可得的點數,以及兌換 1 元所需的點數。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:566
msgid "Per-payment-method bonus"
msgstr "逐付款方式加碼"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:567
msgid "Give extra points for paying with a particular method. Payment methods do not cost the store the same, and points are the cheapest way to steer customers towards the cheaper one. 1 = no change; the bonus stacks with the other multipliers under the same 10x ceiling."
msgstr "使用特定付款方式時給予額外點數。各種付款方式對商店的成本並不相同,而點數是引導顧客改用低成本方式最便宜的手段。1 = 不變;此加碼會與其他倍率相乘,並同樣受 10 倍上限限制。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:569
msgid "Payment method multipliers"
msgstr "付款方式倍率"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:569
msgid "One row per payment method installed on this store."
msgstr "本商店已安裝的每種付款方式各一列。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:574
msgid "WooCommerce Subscriptions"
msgstr "WooCommerce Subscriptions"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:575
msgid "Only applies when the WooCommerce Subscriptions extension is installed. Renewal orders already earn like any other paid order; these settings decide whether that is what you want. A renewal never counts as a first purchase."
msgstr "僅在已安裝 WooCommerce Subscriptions 擴充功能時適用。續訂訂單本來就會像其他已付款訂單一樣賺點;這些設定用來決定那是不是你要的結果。續訂永遠不算首次購買。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:577
msgid "Renewals earn points"
msgstr "續訂可賺點"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:577
msgid "On by default. Turn off to give no points at all on subscription renewals."
msgstr "預設開啟。關閉後,訂閱續訂完全不給點數。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:578
msgid "Renewal multiplier"
msgstr "續訂倍率"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:578
msgid "Multiply earning on renewal orders (1 = same as a normal order, max 10). Staying subscribed is exactly the behaviour worth rewarding."
msgstr "續訂訂單的賺點倍率 (1 = 與一般訂單相同,最多 10)。持續訂閱正是最值得獎勵的行為。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:579
msgid "One-off points when a subscription first becomes active (0 = off). Paid once per subscription."
msgstr "訂閱首次啟用時給予的一次性點數 (0 = 關閉)。每筆訂閱只發放一次。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:585
msgid "Push points messages over the LINE Messaging API (LINE Notify was shut down in 2025 and is not used). Members link their LINE account in the membership plugin; anyone who has not linked is simply skipped. Messages are queued, so LINE can never slow down checkout."
msgstr "透過 LINE Messaging API 推播點數訊息 (LINE Notify 已於 2025 年停止服務,本外掛不使用)。會員在會員外掛中綁定 LINE 帳號;未綁定者一律略過。訊息會排入佇列,因此 LINE 絕不會拖慢結帳。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:587
msgid "Enable the LINE sender. Nothing is sent until a channel access token and at least one event are set."
msgstr "啟用 LINE 發送。在設定頻道存取權杖並至少選擇一種事件之前,不會送出任何訊息。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:588
msgid "Channel access token"
msgstr "頻道存取權杖"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:588
msgid "The long-lived channel access token of your LINE Messaging API channel."
msgstr "你的 LINE Messaging API 頻道的長期頻道存取權杖。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:589
msgid "User-meta key holding the LINE ID"
msgstr "存放 LINE ID 的使用者中繼資料鍵值"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:589
msgid "Where a member's LINE userId is stored. Leave blank for the membership plugin default (_moformember_line_user_id)."
msgstr "會員的 LINE userId 存放位置。留空則使用會員外掛的預設值 (_moformember_line_user_id)。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:590
#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:604
msgid "Send: points earned"
msgstr "發送:賺得點數"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:590
msgid "Message the member when points are credited."
msgstr "點數入帳時通知會員。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:591
#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:605
msgid "Send: points redeemed"
msgstr "發送:兌換點數"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:591
msgid "Message the member when points are spent."
msgstr "點數被使用時通知會員。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:592
#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:606
msgid "Send: points expiring soon"
msgstr "發送:點數即將到期"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:592
msgid "Message the member alongside the expiry reminder e-mail (same idempotent batch, so no duplicates)."
msgstr "與到期提醒信同時通知會員 (共用同一個冪等批次,因此不會重複)。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:598
msgid "Push points events to an ESP, CRM or automation platform (Klaviyo, Brevo, n8n, Zapier, a LINE bot...). Deliveries are queued, so a slow endpoint never delays checkout, and each one is signed so the receiver can verify it. Internal / loopback addresses are refused."
msgstr "把點數事件推送到 ESP、CRM 或自動化平台 (Klaviyo、Brevo、n8n、Zapier、LINE bot⋯)。送出會排入佇列,因此端點再慢也不會延誤結帳,而且每一次送出都附簽章,接收端可以驗證。內部 / loopback 位址會被拒絕。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:600
msgid "Enable the webhook sender. Nothing is sent until an endpoint URL and at least one event are set below."
msgstr "啟用 Webhook 發送。在下方設定端點網址並至少選擇一種事件之前,不會送出任何內容。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:601
msgid "Endpoint URL"
msgstr "端點網址"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:601
msgid "The https:// URL each event is POSTed to as JSON."
msgstr "每個事件會以 JSON 形式 POST 到這個 https:// 網址。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:602
msgid "Signing secret"
msgstr "簽章密鑰"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:602
msgid "Optional. When set, each delivery carries X-Moksafopoi-Signature: sha256=HMAC(body, secret) so the receiver can verify it came from this site."
msgstr "選填。設定後,每次送出都會附上 X-Moksafopoi-Signature: sha256=HMAC(body, secret),接收端可據此驗證確實來自本站。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:603
msgid "Include the member e-mail"
msgstr "附上會員電子郵件"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:603
msgid "Off by default: the payload identifies members by user ID only. Turn on when your ESP needs the e-mail address to match a contact."
msgstr "預設關閉:傳送內容只以使用者 ID 辨識會員。若你的 ESP 需要以電子郵件比對聯絡人,再開啟。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:604
msgid "POST an event whenever points are credited."
msgstr "點數入帳時 POST 一個事件。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:605
msgid "POST an event whenever points are spent."
msgstr "點數被使用時 POST 一個事件。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:606
msgid "POST an event alongside the expiry reminder e-mail (same idempotent batch, so no duplicates)."
msgstr "與到期提醒信同時 POST 一個事件 (共用同一個冪等批次,因此不會重複)。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:607
msgid "Send: quest completed"
msgstr "發送:任務完成"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:607
msgid "POST an event when a member finishes a quest."
msgstr "會員完成任務時 POST 一個事件。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:612
msgid "AI and external access (MCP)"
msgstr "AI 與對外開放(MCP)"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:613
msgid "Open points features to AI tools. Ability registration is on by default and every ability is capability-checked, so an assistant can never do more than you could by hand. The external MCP server is off until you switch it on."
msgstr "把點數功能開放給 AI 工具。Ability 註冊預設為開啟,且每一個 ability 都會檢查權限,因此助理能做的絕不會超過你自己動手能做的範圍。對外的 MCP 伺服器則預設關閉,要自行開啟。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:615
msgid "Read-only endpoints for a headless storefront or app: points/v1/me and points/v1/me/history. They always serve the logged-in customer only — there is no user_id parameter, so one member can never read another."
msgstr "供 headless 前台或 App 使用的唯讀端點:points/v1/me 與 points/v1/me/history。它們一律只服務已登入的顧客本人 —— 沒有 user_id 參數,因此一位會員永遠讀不到另一位。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:616
msgid "Points AI abilities (Abilities)"
msgstr "點數 AI 能力(Abilities)"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:616
msgid "Register points features as WordPress AI abilities (Abilities) for use by AI assistants."
msgstr "把點數功能註冊為 WordPress 的 AI 能力(Abilities),供 AI 助理使用。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:617
msgid "MCP module"
msgstr "MCP 模組"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:617
msgid "Load the MCP server module (still requires the \"External MCP server\" toggle below to actually open access)."
msgstr "載入 MCP 伺服器模組(仍需下方「對外 MCP 伺服器」開關才真正開放)。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:618
msgid "External MCP server"
msgstr "對外 MCP 伺服器"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:618
msgid "Open points abilities to external AI tools (MCP). Off by default."
msgstr "把點數能力開放給外部 AI 工具(MCP)。預設關閉。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:619
msgid "Change-making calls per hour (per account)"
msgstr "每小時可變更資料的呼叫次數 (每個帳號)"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:619
msgid "Cap on how many change-making MCP calls one account may make per hour (0 = no limit). External MCP calls run unattended, so a cap is what turns a runaway agent into a stopped one. Every call, allowed or refused, is recorded in the audit log on the Tools page."
msgstr "限制單一帳號每小時最多可發出幾次「會變更資料」的 MCP 呼叫 (0 = 不限)。外部 MCP 呼叫是無人看管執行的,設上限才能把失控的 agent 變成被擋下的 agent。無論通過或被拒,每一次呼叫都會記錄在「工具」頁的稽核紀錄中。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:620
msgid "Allow external MCP to execute changes"
msgstr "允許外部 MCP 執行變更"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:620
msgid "Expose destructive abilities (add / deduct points, redeem, expire) to external MCP clients. Off by default (read-only). WARNING: external MCP calls run UNATTENDED with no confirmation step, so only administrator-level accounts (manage_options) can execute them, and the settings-change tool is never exposed over MCP. Leave off unless you fully trust the connected agent."
msgstr "把破壞性功能 (增減點數、兌換、到期) 開放給外部 MCP 用戶端。預設關閉 (唯讀)。警告:外部 MCP 呼叫是「無人看管」執行且沒有確認步驟,因此只有管理員層級帳號 (manage_options) 能執行,而變更設定的工具永遠不會透過 MCP 開放。除非你完全信任連線的 agent,否則請保持關閉。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:807
msgid "Settings saved."
msgstr "設定已儲存。"

#. translators: 1: applied count, 2: skipped count.
#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:814
#, php-format
msgid "Imported %1$d setting(s) (skipped %2$d)."
msgstr "已匯入 %1$d 項設定(略過 %2$d 項)。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:818
msgid "Settings import failed: the file is invalid or the format does not match."
msgstr "設定匯入失敗:檔案無效或格式不符。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:879
msgid "Save settings"
msgstr "儲存設定"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:924
#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:927
msgid "Email preview"
msgstr "信件預覽"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:926
msgid "Below is a sample appearance of the \"Points expiry reminder\" email (using sample data). After saving, this preview applies the latest header background color and text."
msgstr "以下為「點數到期提醒」信件的範例外觀(使用範例資料)。儲存後此預覽會套用最新的標頭底色與文字。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:1195
msgid "Select categories (multiple allowed)…"
msgstr "選擇分類(可多選)…"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:1291
msgid "Amount reached (NT$)"
msgstr "滿額(NT$)"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:1292
#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:1499
msgid "Multiplier"
msgstr "倍率"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:1318
msgid "Tier name"
msgstr "階梯名稱"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:1319
msgid "Lifetime points needed"
msgstr "所需終身累積點數"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:1389
msgid "Quest name"
msgstr "任務名稱"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:1390
msgid "What is counted"
msgstr "計數的事件"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:1392
msgid "Reward points"
msgstr "獎勵點數"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:1493
msgid "No payment methods are installed yet."
msgstr "尚未安裝任何付款方式。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:1498
msgid "Payment method"
msgstr "付款方式"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:1555
msgid "Currency"
msgstr "貨幣"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:1556
msgid "Points earned per 1 unit"
msgstr "每 1 元可得點數"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:1557
msgid "Points to redeem 1 unit"
msgstr "兌換 1 元所需點數"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:1563
#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:1565
msgid "auto"
msgstr "自動"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:1671
msgid "Please choose a CSV file to upload."
msgstr "請選擇要上傳的 CSV 檔案。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:1709
msgid "Compact old ledger entries"
msgstr "壓縮舊帳本紀錄"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:1712
msgid "Replace each member's entries older than the cutoff with a single opening-balance row. Balances stay exactly the same — the sum is preserved and verified per member before anything is deleted — but the individual old rows are gone for good."
msgstr "把每位會員早於分界時間的紀錄,換成單獨一列期初餘額。餘額完全不變 —— 刪除任何資料前都會逐位會員驗證總和 —— 但個別的舊紀錄將永久消失。"

#. translators: %s: the minimum age in days that may be compacted.
#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:1718
#, php-format
msgid "Entries newer than %s days are never compacted: deleting a row also deletes the duplicate-protection key that stops a replayed payment notification from awarding the same points twice. Entries that have not expired yet are left alone too, because they are still live inventory for the expiry engine."
msgstr "%s 天內的紀錄永遠不會被壓縮:刪除一列的同時也會刪掉防重複的鍵值,而那正是阻止重送的付款通知重複發點的機制。尚未到期的紀錄同樣不會被動到,因為它們對到期引擎而言仍是有效庫存。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:1727
msgid "Compact entries older than (days)"
msgstr "壓縮早於幾天前的紀錄"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:1733
#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:1806
msgid "Preview only (write nothing)"
msgstr "僅試算 (不寫入任何資料)"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:1734
msgid "Old entries will be replaced by one opening-balance row per member. Balances do not change, but the old rows cannot be recovered. Continue?"
