#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:1788
msgid "Seed existing balances when moving from another plugin or a spreadsheet. The first row must be a header; the \"user\" column accepts a user ID, e-mail or username, and the optional columns are points, credit, note and expires_at (YYYY-MM-DD)."
msgstr "從其他外掛或試算表搬家時,可用來建立既有餘額。第一列必須是標題列;「user」欄可填使用者 ID、電子郵件或使用者名稱,選填欄位為 points、credit、note 與 expires_at (YYYY-MM-DD)。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsScreen.php:1792
msgid "Every row is booked once per batch code, so re-uploading the same file with the same batch code adds nothing a second time. Always run the preview first — it reports exactly what would happen and writes nothing."
msgstr "每一列都以批次代號為單位只入帳一次,因此用同一個批次代號重新上傳同一個檔案不會再次入帳。請務必先執行試算 —— 它會完整回報將會發生什麼事,而且不寫入任何資料。"

