#: src/Support/Forecast.php:148
msgid "Priced at the bottom quartile so about three quarters of members can already redeem it — a programme where nobody can afford anything is a programme nobody uses."
msgstr "定在第一四分位,約四分之三的會員現在就換得起 —— 一個沒有人換得起任何東西的計畫,不會有人使用。"

