msgstr "定在餘額中位數:一半的會員現在就能換到的日常獎勵。"

#: src/Support/Forecast.php:160
msgid "Priced near the top decile — something to save towards, which is what keeps balances from being spent the moment they appear."
msgstr "定在前 10% 附近 —— 值得存下去的目標,這正是讓餘額不會一到手就花光的原因。"

#. translators: 1: points outstanding; 2: their monetary value.
#: src/Support/Forecast.php:189
#, php-format
