msgstr "目前流通中的點數為 %1$s,若所有會員今天全數兌換,約值 NT$%2$s。"

#. translators: %s: points expiring within 30 days.
#: src/Support/Forecast.php:201
#, php-format
msgid "%s points expire within 30 days — a reminder campaign now converts them into orders instead of into breakage."
msgstr "有 %s 點將在 30 天內到期 —— 現在發動提醒活動,可以把它們變成訂單而不是耗損。"

#. translators: 1: redemption rate; 2: breakage rate.
#: src/Support/Forecast.php:212
