msgid "%1$s%% of all points issued have been redeemed and %2$s%% expired unused."
msgstr "所有已發出的點數中,%1$s%% 已被兌換、%2$s%% 過期未用。"

#: src/Support/Forecast.php:221
msgid "Redemption is under 20%: members are collecting but not spending. Usually the cheapest reward is still out of reach — check the entry-level suggestion below."
msgstr "兌換率低於 20%:會員只收集不使用。通常是因為最便宜的獎勵仍然換不起 —— 請參考下方的入門價位建議。"

#: src/Support/Forecast.php:229
msgid "More points were redeemed than issued in the last 30 days — the outstanding liability is shrinking, which is healthy, but check that earning is still switched on."
msgstr "近 30 天兌換的點數多於發出的點數 —— 未兌換負債正在下降,這是健康的,但請確認賺點功能仍然是開啟的。"

